{"title": "Achievements", "pageid": 8172, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Achievements", "categories": ["Achievements"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>There are 54 achievements in Baldur’s Gate 3.\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Icon\n</th>\n<th>Name\n</th>\n<th>Description\n</th>\n<th>Hidden\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:A-A_Grym_Fate.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><img src=\"/w/images/f/f8/A-A_Grym_Fate.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f8/A-A_Grym_Fate.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>A Grym Fate<span class=\"anchor\" id=\"A_Grym_Fate\"></span>\n</td>\n<td>Kill <a href=\"/wiki/Grym\" title=\"Grym\">the Adamantine Golem</a> without using the Forge Hammer.\n</td>\n<td>Yes\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:A-Absolute_Power_Corrupts.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><img src=\"/w/images/0/01/A-Absolute_Power_Corrupts.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/01/A-Absolute_Power_Corrupts.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>Absolute Power Corrupts<span class=\"anchor\" id=\"Absolute_Power_Corrupts\"></span>\n</td>\n<td>Reign with terror: take control of the <a href=\"/wiki/Netherbrain\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Netherbrain\">Netherbrain</a> and bend the world to your will.\n</td>\n<td>Yes\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:A-Action_Surge.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><img src=\"/w/images/1/10/A-Action_Surge.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/10/A-Action_Surge.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Guide:Action_Surge_(achievement)\" title=\"Guide:Action Surge (achievement)\">Action Surge</a><span class=\"anchor\" id=\"Action_Surge\"></span>\n</td>\n<td>Perform five attacks in one turn. Your enemies won't know what hit them (literally).\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:A-All%27s_Well_That_Ends_Well.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><img src=\"/w/images/7/7e/A-All%27s_Well_That_Ends_Well.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7e/A-All%27s_Well_That_Ends_Well.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>All's Well That Ends Well<span class=\"anchor\" id=\"All's_Well_That_Ends_Well\"></span>\n</td>\n<td>Finish the game (with a heartfelt 'thank you' from Larian Studios).\n</td>\n<td>Yes\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:A-Bedrolls_and_Breakfast.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><img src=\"/w/images/5/57/A-Bedrolls_and_Breakfast.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/57/A-Bedrolls_and_Breakfast.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>Bedrolls and Breakfast<span class=\"anchor\" id=\"Bedrolls_and_Breakfast\"></span>\n</td>\n<td>Take four full <a href=\"/wiki/Long_Rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long Rest\">Long Rests</a> in a single playthrough - adventuring's tiring work.\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:A-Bookworm.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><img src=\"/w/images/7/78/A-Bookworm.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/78/A-Bookworm.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>Bookworm<span class=\"anchor\" id=\"Bookworm\"></span>\n</td>\n<td>Read 100 different books in a single playthrough. Adventuring isn't just daring quests, you know.\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:A-Bottoms_Up.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><img src=\"/w/images/9/92/A-Bottoms_Up.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/92/A-Bottoms_Up.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>Bottoms Up<span class=\"anchor\" id=\"Bottoms_Up\"></span>\n</td>\n<td>Long Rest using only alcohol - a time-honoured dwarven tradition.\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:A-Busker.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><img src=\"/w/images/7/72/A-Busker.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/72/A-Busker.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>Busker<span class=\"anchor\" id=\"Busker\"></span>\n</td>\n<td>Earn a hundred gold from <a href=\"/wiki/Perform_(disambiguation)\" title=\"Perform (disambiguation)\">playing sweet, sweet music</a> in a single playthrough.\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:A-Ceremorphosis.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><img src=\"/w/images/c/c0/A-Ceremorphosis.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c0/A-Ceremorphosis.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>Ceremorphosis<span class=\"anchor\" id=\"Ceremorphosis\"></span>\n</td>\n<td>Make the ultimate sacrifice: become a mind flayer to defeat the Netherbrain.\n</td>\n<td>Yes\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:A-Crash_Landing.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><img src=\"/w/images/5/52/A-Crash_Landing.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/52/A-Crash_Landing.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>Crash Landing<span class=\"anchor\" id=\"Crash_Landing\"></span>\n</td>\n<td>In the <a href=\"/wiki/Wyrmway\" title=\"Wyrmway\">Wyrmway</a>, wait until the dragon is mid-flight, then knock it out of the sky - KAPOW.\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:A-Critical_Hit.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><img src=\"/w/images/0/03/A-Critical_Hit.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/03/A-Critical_Hit.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>Critical Hit <span class=\"anchor\" id=\"Critical_Hit\"></span>\n</td>\n<td>Complete the game in <a href=\"/wiki/Tactician\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Tactician\">Tactician</a> mode.\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:A-Descent_from_Avernus.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><img src=\"/w/images/5/5e/A-Descent_from_Avernus.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5e/A-Descent_from_Avernus.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>Descent From Avernus<span class=\"anchor\" id=\"Descent_From_Avernus\"></span>\n</td>\n<td>Take control of the nautiloid and escape the Hells.\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:A-Devil%27s_in_the_Details.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><img src=\"/w/images/f/fb/A-Devil%27s_in_the_Details.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fb/A-Devil%27s_in_the_Details.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>Devil's in the Details<span class=\"anchor\" id=\"Devil's_in_the_Details\"></span>\n</td>\n<td>Defeat Commander <a href=\"/wiki/Zhalk\" title=\"Zhalk\">Zhalk</a> on the nautiloid.\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:A-Dig_for_Victory.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><img src=\"/w/images/1/1b/A-Dig_for_Victory.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1b/A-Dig_for_Victory.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>Dig for Victory<span class=\"anchor\" id=\"Dig_for_Victory\"></span>\n</td>\n<td>Dig up five buried chests in a single playthrough - treasure!\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:A-Embrace_Your_Urge.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><img src=\"/w/images/7/7f/A-Embrace_Your_Urge.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7f/A-Embrace_Your_Urge.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>Embrace Your Urge<span class=\"anchor\" id=\"Embrace_Your_Urge\"></span>\n</td>\n<td>Become Bhaal's ultimate weapon - become his Slayer.\n</td>\n<td>Yes\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:A-Escapologist.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><img src=\"/w/images/4/45/A-Escapologist.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/45/A-Escapologist.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>Escapologist<span class=\"anchor\" id=\"Escapologist\"></span>\n</td>\n<td>Break out of prison after being arrested - aren't you daring?\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:A-Expand_Your_Mind.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><img src=\"/w/images/b/be/A-Expand_Your_Mind.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/be/A-Expand_Your_Mind.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>Expand Your Mind<span class=\"anchor\" id=\"Expand_Your_Mind\"></span>\n</td>\n<td>Consume a parasite and unlock a new power - is it meant to wriggle the whole way down?\n</td>\n<td>Yes\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:A-Fancy_Footwork.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><img src=\"/w/images/8/8d/A-Fancy_Footwork.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8d/A-Fancy_Footwork.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Guide:Fancy_Footwork_(achievement)\" title=\"Guide:Fancy Footwork (achievement)\">Fancy Footwork</a><span class=\"anchor\" id=\"Fancy_Footwork\"></span>\n</td>\n<td>Defeat Gortash in Wyrm's Rock without activating any traps.\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:A-Fetch_Quest.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><img src=\"/w/images/f/f8/A-Fetch_Quest.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f8/A-Fetch_Quest.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>Fetch Quest<span class=\"anchor\" id=\"Fetch_Quest\"></span>\n</td>\n<td>Play fetch with <a href=\"/wiki/Scratch\" title=\"Scratch\">Scratch</a> - the best boy in the Realms.\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:A-First_Blood.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><img src=\"/w/images/e/e4/A-First_Blood.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e4/A-First_Blood.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>First Blood<span class=\"anchor\" id=\"First_Blood\"></span>\n</td>\n<td>Kill <a href=\"/wiki/Orin\" title=\"Orin\">Orin</a> while her cultists are performing their ritual chant.\n</td>\n<td>Yes\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:A-Fists_of_Fury.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><img src=\"/w/images/2/21/A-Fists_of_Fury.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/21/A-Fists_of_Fury.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>Fists of Fury<span class=\"anchor\" id=\"Fists_of_Fury\"></span>\n</td>\n<td>Kill a character with an <a href=\"/wiki/Unarmed_Strike\" title=\"Unarmed Strike\">Unarmed Strike</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:A-Foehammer.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><img src=\"/w/images/c/ca/A-Foehammer.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/ca/A-Foehammer.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>Foehammer<span class=\"anchor\" id=\"Foehammer\"></span>\n</td>\n<td>Complete the game in <a href=\"/wiki/Honour\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Honour\">Honour</a> mode.\n</td>\n<td>Yes (GOG)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:A-Forged_in_Blood_and_Fire.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><img src=\"/w/images/2/2a/A-Forged_in_Blood_and_Fire.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2a/A-Forged_in_Blood_and_Fire.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>Forged in Blood and Fire<span class=\"anchor\" id=\"Forged_in_Blood_and_Fire\"></span>\n</td>\n<td>Craft an item in the <a href=\"/wiki/Adamantine_Forge_(location)\" title=\"Adamantine Forge (location)\">Adamantine Forge</a>.\n</td>\n<td>Yes\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:A-Hero_of_the_Forgotten_Realms.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><img src=\"/w/images/b/b5/A-Hero_of_the_Forgotten_Realms.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b5/A-Hero_of_the_Forgotten_Realms.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>Hero of the Forgotten Realms<span class=\"anchor\" id=\"Hero_of_the_Forgotten_Realms\"></span>\n</td>\n<td>Save the day: kill the Netherbrain and destroy the Absolute tadpoles.\n</td>\n<td>Yes\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:A-Homebrewer.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><img src=\"/w/images/4/48/A-Homebrewer.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/48/A-Homebrewer.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>Homebrewer<span class=\"anchor\" id=\"Homebrewer\"></span>\n</td>\n<td>Create three unique <a href=\"/wiki/Alchemy\" title=\"Alchemy\">alchemical solutions</a> in a single playthrough - bottoms up!\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:A-Hot_Date.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><img src=\"/w/images/c/c4/A-Hot_Date.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c4/A-Hot_Date.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>Hot Date<span class=\"anchor\" id=\"Hot_Date\"></span>\n</td>\n<td>Go on a date with <a href=\"/wiki/Karlach\" title=\"Karlach\">Karlach</a> - now that's playing with fire.\n</td>\n<td>Yes\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:A-Interfectorem_Draconis.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><img src=\"/w/images/8/8c/A-Interfectorem_Draconis.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8c/A-Interfectorem_Draconis.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>Interfectorem Draconis<span class=\"anchor\" id=\"Interfectorem_Draconis\"></span>\n</td>\n<td>Kill the <a href=\"/wiki/Confront_the_Elder_Brain\" title=\"Confront the Elder Brain\">red dragon in the Upper City</a>.\n</td>\n<td>Yes\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:A-Jack-of-all-Trades.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><img src=\"/w/images/e/eb/A-Jack-of-all-Trades.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/eb/A-Jack-of-all-Trades.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>Jack-of-all-Trades<span class=\"anchor\" id=\"Jack-of-all-Trades\"></span>\n</td>\n<td>Multiclass into every class in one playthrough without asking Withers to change your character.<sup id=\"cite_ref-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:A-Just_a_Nibble.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><img src=\"/w/images/c/c7/A-Just_a_Nibble.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c7/A-Just_a_Nibble.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>Just a Nibble<span class=\"anchor\" id=\"Just_a_Nibble\"></span>\n</td>\n<td>Let <a href=\"/wiki/Astarion\" title=\"Astarion\">Astarion</a> bite you - ouch.\n</td>\n<td>Yes\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:A-Kill_Two_Birds_With_One_Gnome.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><img src=\"/w/images/5/56/A-Kill_Two_Birds_With_One_Gnome.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/56/A-Kill_Two_Birds_With_One_Gnome.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>Kill Two Birds With One Gnome<span class=\"anchor\" id=\"Kill_Two_Birds_With_One_Gnome\"></span>\n</td>\n<td>Use one enemy as an improvised weapon against another.<sup id=\"cite_ref-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:A-Leave_No_One_Behind.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><img src=\"/w/images/a/ab/A-Leave_No_One_Behind.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ab/A-Leave_No_One_Behind.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Leave_No_One_Behind\" title=\"Leave No One Behind\">Leave No One Behind</a><span class=\"anchor\" id=\"Leave_No_One_Behind\"></span>\n</td>\n<td>Save every tiefling refugee you can throughout the game in a single playthrough.\n</td>\n<td>Yes\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:A-Loophole.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><img src=\"/w/images/3/3b/A-Loophole.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3b/A-Loophole.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>Loophole<span class=\"anchor\" id=\"Loophole\"></span>\n</td>\n<td>Break <a href=\"/wiki/Wyll\" title=\"Wyll\">Wyll</a>'s pact with <a href=\"/wiki/Mizora\" title=\"Mizora\">Mizora</a>.\n</td>\n<td>Yes\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:A-Mind_Blown.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><img src=\"/w/images/6/6c/A-Mind_Blown.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6c/A-Mind_Blown.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>Mind Blown<span class=\"anchor\" id=\"Mind_Blown\"></span>\n</td>\n<td>Romance <a href=\"/wiki/The_Emperor\" title=\"The Emperor\">the Emperor</a>.\n</td>\n<td>Yes\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:A-Murder_in_Baldur%27s_Gate.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><img src=\"/w/images/5/5d/A-Murder_in_Baldur%27s_Gate.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5d/A-Murder_in_Baldur%27s_Gate.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>Murder in Baldur's Gate<span class=\"anchor\" id=\"Murder_in_Baldur's_Gate\"></span>\n</td>\n<td>Coat the streets of Baldur's Gate in blood - become an Unholy Assassin of Bhaal.\n</td>\n<td>Yes\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:A-No_Free_Lunches.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><img src=\"/w/images/5/5c/A-No_Free_Lunches.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5c/A-No_Free_Lunches.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Guide:No_Free_Lunches\" title=\"Guide:No Free Lunches\">No Free Lunches<span class=\"anchor\" id=\"No_Free_Lunches\"></span></a>\n</td>\n<td>Defeat the <a href=\"/wiki/Apostle_of_Myrkul\" title=\"Apostle of Myrkul\">Apostle of Myrkul</a> before it consumes any necromites.\n</td>\n<td>Yes\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:A-No_Penny_Required.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><img src=\"/w/images/d/d7/A-No_Penny_Required.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d7/A-No_Penny_Required.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>No Penny Required<span class=\"anchor\" id=\"No_Penny_Required\"></span>\n</td>\n<td>Successfully use <a href=\"/wiki/Detect_Thoughts\" title=\"Detect Thoughts\">Detect Thoughts</a> to pry into someone's thoughts.\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:A-Non-Invasive_Procedure.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><img src=\"/w/images/c/c8/A-Non-Invasive_Procedure.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c8/A-Non-Invasive_Procedure.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Non-Invasive_Procedure\" title=\"Non-Invasive Procedure\">Non-Invasive Procedure</a><span class=\"anchor\" id=\"Non-Invasive_Procedure\"></span>\n</td>\n<td>Kill the Surgeon before he performs surgery on you in combat.\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:A-Outsourcing.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><img src=\"/w/images/d/d5/A-Outsourcing.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d5/A-Outsourcing.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>Outsourcing<span class=\"anchor\" id=\"Outsourcing\"></span>\n</td>\n<td>Recruit a <a href=\"/wiki/Hireling\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Hireling\">hireling</a>. You can befriend them or use them as cannon-fodder - we won't judge.\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:A-Penny_Pincher.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><img src=\"/w/images/c/ce/A-Penny_Pincher.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/ce/A-Penny_Pincher.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>Penny Pincher<span class=\"anchor\" id=\"Penny_Pincher\"></span>\n</td>\n<td>Defeat the <a href=\"/wiki/Gerringothe_Thorm\" title=\"Gerringothe Thorm\">Toll Collector</a> without her using gold against you - excellent budgeting.\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:A-Pest_Control.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><img src=\"/w/images/3/3e/A-Pest_Control.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3e/A-Pest_Control.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Pest_Control\" title=\"Pest Control\">Pest Control</a><span class=\"anchor\" id=\"Pest_Control\"></span>\n</td>\n<td>Kill the Spider Matriarch before her eggs hatch - why do they have so many legs?\n</td>\n<td>Yes\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:A-Punch_Drunk.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><img src=\"/w/images/0/00/A-Punch_Drunk.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/00/A-Punch_Drunk.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Punch_Drunk\" title=\"Punch Drunk\">Punch Drunk</a><span class=\"anchor\" id=\"Punch_Drunk\"></span>\n</td>\n<td>Defeat twenty opponents while a party character is drunk in a single playthrough - down them.\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:A-Repairing_the_Weave.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><img src=\"/w/images/b/b2/A-Repairing_the_Weave.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b2/A-Repairing_the_Weave.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>Repairing the Weave<span class=\"anchor\" id=\"Repairing_the_Weave\"></span>\n</td>\n<td>Stabilise <a href=\"/wiki/Gale\" title=\"Gale\">Gale</a>'s Netherese orb.\n</td>\n<td>Yes\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:A-Roleplayer.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><img src=\"/w/images/c/ca/A-Roleplayer.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/ca/A-Roleplayer.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>Roleplayer<span class=\"anchor\" id=\"Roleplayer\"></span>\n</td>\n<td>Complete ten background goals in a single playthrough - you are one with your character.\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:A-Rude,_Crude,_and_Full_of_Attitude.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><img src=\"/w/images/3/32/A-Rude%2C_Crude%2C_and_Full_of_Attitude.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/32/A-Rude%2C_Crude%2C_and_Full_of_Attitude.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Scroll_of_Summon_Quasit\" title=\"Scroll of Summon Quasit\">Rude, Crude, and Full of Attitude</a><span class=\"anchor\" id=\"Rude,_Crude,_and_Full_of_Attitude\"></span>\n</td>\n<td>Find and summon the quasit Shovel. Or is her name... Fork? Maybe Basket?\n</td>\n<td>Yes\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:A-She_Cannot_Be_Caged!.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><img src=\"/w/images/e/ec/A-She_Cannot_Be_Caged%21.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/ec/A-She_Cannot_Be_Caged%21.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Guide:She_Cannot_Be_Caged!\" title=\"Guide:She Cannot Be Caged!\">She Cannot Be Caged!</a><span class=\"anchor\" id=\"She_Cannot_Be_Caged!\"></span>\n</td>\n<td>Rescue Sazza from the Emerald Grove, Goblin Camp and Moonrise Towers in one playthrough.\n</td>\n<td>Yes\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:A-Shove_Off.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><img src=\"/w/images/7/7e/A-Shove_Off.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7e/A-Shove_Off.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>Shove Off <span class=\"anchor\" id=\"Shove_Off\"></span>\n</td>\n<td>Kill a creature with falling damage.\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:A-Sins_of_the_Father.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><img src=\"/w/images/8/80/A-Sins_of_the_Father.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/80/A-Sins_of_the_Father.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>Sins of the Father<span class=\"anchor\" id=\"Sins_of_the_Father\"></span>\n</td>\n<td>Claim your Throne of Blood: take control of the Netherbrain for Bhaal and break the world.\n</td>\n<td>Yes\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:A-Taking_Blood.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><img src=\"/w/images/b/b5/A-Taking_Blood.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b5/A-Taking_Blood.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>Taking Blood<span class=\"anchor\" id=\"Taking_Blood\"></span>\n</td>\n<td>Steal the <a href=\"/wiki/Blood_of_Lathander\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Blood of Lathander\">Blood of Lathander</a> from underneath Rosymorn Monastery.\n</td>\n<td>Yes\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:A-The_City_Awaits.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><img src=\"/w/images/9/92/A-The_City_Awaits.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/92/A-The_City_Awaits.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>The City Awaits<span class=\"anchor\" id=\"The_City_Awaits\"></span>\n</td>\n<td>Leave Act II - Baldur's Gate is just over the horizon.\n</td>\n<td>Yes\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:A-The_Lich-Queen%27s_Wrath.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><img src=\"/w/images/a/af/A-The_Lich-Queen%27s_Wrath.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/af/A-The_Lich-Queen%27s_Wrath.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>The Lich-Queen's Wrath<span class=\"anchor\" id=\"The_Lich-Queen's_Wrath\"></span>\n</td>\n<td>Ally with <a href=\"/wiki/Voss\" title=\"Voss\">Voss</a> against the githyanki God-Queen. Good luck.\n</td>\n<td>Yes\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:A-The_Plot_Thickens.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><img src=\"/w/images/5/53/A-The_Plot_Thickens.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/53/A-The_Plot_Thickens.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>The Plot Thickens<span class=\"anchor\" id=\"The_Plot_Thickens\"></span>\n</td>\n<td>Leave Act I - for somewhere altogether darker.\n</td>\n<td>Yes\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:A-To_Bloom_in_Darkest_Night.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><img src=\"/w/images/7/7f/A-To_Bloom_in_Darkest_Night.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7f/A-To_Bloom_in_Darkest_Night.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>To Bloom in Darkest Night<span class=\"anchor\" id=\"To_Bloom_in_Darkest_Night\"></span>\n</td>\n<td>Gift Shadowheart a <a href=\"/wiki/Night_Orchid\" title=\"Night Orchid\">night orchid</a> - her favourite flower. Always knew she was a softie.\n</td>\n<td>Yes\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:A-Under_Lock_and_Key.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><img src=\"/w/images/5/59/A-Under_Lock_and_Key.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/59/A-Under_Lock_and_Key.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Guide:Under_Lock_and_Key\" title=\"Guide:Under Lock and Key\">Under Lock and Key</a> <span class=\"anchor\" id=\"Under_Lock_and_Key\"></span>\n</td>\n<td>Rescue all the prisoners from the depths of <a href=\"/wiki/Moonrise_Towers\" title=\"Moonrise Towers\">Moonrise Towers</a> in one playthrough.\n</td>\n<td>Yes\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:A-You_Have_Two_Hands_for_a_Reason.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><img src=\"/w/images/b/bc/A-You_Have_Two_Hands_for_a_Reason.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/bc/A-You_Have_Two_Hands_for_a_Reason.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>You Have Two Hands for a Reason<span class=\"anchor\" id=\"You_Have_Two_Hands_for_a_Reason\"></span>\n</td>\n<td>Pet Scratch and the <a href=\"/wiki/Owlbear_Cub\" title=\"Owlbear Cub\">owlbear cub</a> at the same time - the greatest joy an adventurer could ask for.\n</td>\n<td>Yes\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<div class=\"notebegin\">\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r345964\">.mw-parser-output .reflist .references{list-style-type:inherit}.mw-parser-output .refs-act1::before{content:\"Act 1\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}.mw-parser-output .refs-act2::before{content:\"Act 2\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}.mw-parser-output .refs-act3::before{content:\"Act 3\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-style:italic;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}.mw-parser-output .refs-url::before{content:\"External links\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}.mw-parser-output .refs-text::before{content:\"Literature\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}.mw-parser-output .refs-note::before{content:\"Notes\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}</style><div class=\"reflist refs-nogroup\" style=\"list-style-type:decimal;\"><div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite_note-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-1\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"> This does not have to be done by the player character or even a party member. A summoned creature, such as an <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Earth_Elemental\" title=\"Earth Elemental\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/64/Portrait_Earth_Elemental.png/20px-Portrait_Earth_Elemental.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/64/Portrait_Earth_Elemental.png/30px-Portrait_Earth_Elemental.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/64/Portrait_Earth_Elemental.png/40px-Portrait_Earth_Elemental.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Earth Elemental\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/64/Portrait_Earth_Elemental.png/20px-Portrait_Earth_Elemental.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/64/Portrait_Earth_Elemental.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Earth_Elemental\" title=\"Earth Elemental\">Earth Elemental</a>, which kills with an unarmed strike is sufficient. </span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-2\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-2\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"> Although the Jack-of-all-Trades achievement description may imply otherwise, <i>any</i> origin character can be used to earn this achievement, as well as <a href=\"/wiki/Hireling\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Hireling\">hirelings</a>. </span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-3\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-3\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"> The <a href=\"/wiki/Throw\" title=\"Throw\">Throw</a> action does not work for this. It must be <a href=\"/wiki/Improvised_Melee_Weapon\" title=\"Improvised Melee Weapon\">Improvised Melee Weapon</a> or its <a href=\"/wiki/Improvised_Melee_Weapon_(Bonus_Action)\" title=\"Improvised Melee Weapon (Bonus Action)\">bonus action variant</a>. </span>\n</li>\n</ol></div></div>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span></h2>\n<ul><li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://steamcommunity.com/stats/1086940/achievements/\">Steam Achievements page</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714195138\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.086 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.088 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 901/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 8181/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 1123/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 23/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 3273/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.020/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1117238/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   47.881      1 -total\n 52.46%   25.118     54 Template:Anchor\n 25.56%   12.240      1 Template:Reflist\n 16.34%    7.823      3 Template:Ref\n 10.89%    5.216      1 Template:SmCharLink\n  6.66%    3.191      1 Template:Icon_link\n  5.96%    2.854      1 Template:Icon_text\n  3.87%    1.853      2 Template:Trim\n  1.90%    0.912      1 Template:Ifempty\n  1.69%    0.810      1 Template:Icon\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:8172-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714195138 and revision id 369699. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}